.cargo

# Crate sources are fetched by the bootstrap and verified against the SHA-256
# that Cargo.lock already pins for each one, so committing them would only
# duplicate the lock at ~150 MB per dependency update.
vendor/*.crate
vendor/*.part

# Only reindeer needs the local registry index, when regenerating.
vendor/index/

# Cargo.lock records no checksum for a git dependency, so there is nothing to
# verify a fetch against and this archive is committed instead. scripts/
# fetch-buck-deps.py fails with the name of any other crate that needs adding.
!vendor/egui-notify-*.crate
